{
  "version": 2,
  "status": "canonical",
  "source": "docs/eng/51-modelo-autorizacao.md",
  "notes": [
    "XCUT-05 consolidates the former TypeScript catalog into this JSON seed and canonicalizes permission keys from dominio:acao to dominio.acao.",
    "The live pre-XCUT-05 JSON already had 19 entries; the 6 entries absent there and recovered from the TypeScript catalog are: auth.read, iam.read, gestao.read, gestao.write, rh.read, rh.write."
